{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-methods","title":"数值方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monte-carlo-methods","title":"蒙特卡洛模拟定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods/monte-carlo-methods","wordCount":1858,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"finite-difference","title":"有限差分方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods/finite-difference","wordCount":2087,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"tree-lattice-models","title":"树模型与格子方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/numerical-methods/tree-lattice-models","wordCount":1947,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数值方法\">数值方法</h1><p>本章系统介绍衍生品定价中的三大数值方法。蒙特卡洛模拟通过随机路径生成实现高维衍生品的灵活定价；有限差分方法将偏微分方程离散化求解，适用于低维但路径依赖的问题；树模型和格子方法通过离散化资产价格动态提供直观的回溯定价框架。三篇文档各自阐述方法原理、收敛性分析、方差缩减/加速技巧及完整的 Python 实现。</p>\n"}